              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ita 41:40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuk’ uwo Muyuda Moridekayi, uwar’ amurengeye yar’ umwami Ahasuwerusi gusa, kandi yar’ agahambaye mu Bayuda, yashimwa n’ab’i wabo uko bangana; kandi yama yendeza ubgoko bgabo ivyiza, akavuga ibihesha uruvyaro rwabo amahoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
